Third-party components
----------------------

None. Ledger has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim on
26/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used to export the ledger

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

No bank connection, ever
------------------------

There is no network code in this app: no fetch, no XMLHttpRequest, no WebSocket, no beacon, no URL
anywhere in the engine, and the page's Content-Security-Policy sets connect-src 'none'. It cannot
reach a bank even if someone asked it to.

Money
-----

Every amount is an integer number of paise. Rupee arithmetic in floating point drifts — 4.35 * 100 is
434.99999999999994 — so the engine never does it, and the test suite pins those exact values.

Not a tax or accounting adviser
-------------------------------

This is a bookkeeping tool. It records what you enter and reports what the entries say. It does not
give tax advice, and it is not a substitute for an accountant.
